  </div>
</div>

<!-- ============ 2. MAIL ĐANG XỬ LÝ ============ -->
<div class="demo-h">TAB MAIL ĐANG XỬ LÝ <span>— tab PIC giữ nguyên, thẻ dùng chung bố cục</span></div>

<div class="pic-subtabs">
  <button class="pic-subtab-btn active">👤 Nhật Minh <span class="pic-subtab-count">2</span></button>
  <button class="pic-subtab-btn">👤 Wendy <span class="pic-subtab-count">1</span></button>
</div>

<div class="mail-card">
  <div class="mail-card__head">
    <span class="who">Sarah Chen</span>
    <span class="km">W1.4</span>
    <span class="chip pic">Đang xử lý: Tư Hân</span>
    <a href="#" class="thread-link">↗ Mở thread trong Gmail</a>
    <span class="spacer"></span>
    <span class="when">10/09/2026 · 21:03</span>
  </div>
  <div class="mail-card__left">
    <dl class="meta-grid">
      <dt>Khách mời</dt><dd><strong>Sarah Chen</strong></dd>
      <dt>Đơn vị</dt><dd>World Economic Forum</dd>
      <dt>Phụ trách</dt><dd><span class="chip pic">👤 Nhật Minh</span> <span class="chip support">🧑‍💼 Tư Hân</span></dd>
    </dl>
    <div class="subject-line">Re: Speaker slot — AEF 2026 opening plenary</div>
    <div class="mail-body">We would need the final agenda and the moderator's name before confirming. Could you send them by 20 September?</div>
    <div class="triage">
      <div class="triage-row">
